But we need to construct route: root product (target) -> reaction using template 324324 with children precursors: precursor1 (from apply_template-1) and precursor2 (from apply_template-1). Then each precursor may be further broken down using other templates.

From data: For precursor1 "Cc1ccc(NS(=O)(=O)c2ccc(/C=C/C(=O)O)cc2)cc1" we have template 1914396 applied to produce precursors: ['Cc1ccc(NS(=O)(=O)c2ccc(C=O)cc2)cc1', 'O=C(O)CC(=O)O'].

